Next, I need to find the magnitude of $ \overline{z}^2 $. I remember that the magnitude of a product of two complex numbers is the product of their magnitudes. So, $ |\overline{z}^2| = |\overline{z} \cdot \overline{z}| = |\overline{z}| \cdot |\overline{z}| $. 

