Alternatively, I could also think about the property that the magnitude of a complex number raised to a power is the magnitude of the complex number raised to that power. So, $ |\overline{z}^2| = |\overline{z}|^2 $. 

Either way, whether I use the product property or the power property, I get the same result: $ 5^2 = 25 $.

So, the answer is 25.
